label battle_begin
join fufu center
join crusader center
crusader: I've got to stop you, Fufu!
fufu: Another machine distracting me?
[end_timeline]
label player_victory
join fufu center
join crusader center
crusader: I should have known I couldn't defeat you. I'm sorry, Katie.
fufu: How do you know that name? You're coming with me, cyborg.
[end_timeline]
label player_defeat
join crusader center
crusader: I can't believe it, but we did it. Now maybe we can find Katie...
leave crusader
join fufu center
fufu: This defeat is merely a setback.
[end_timeline]
label repeat
join crusader center
crusader: Yeah?
[end_timeline]